# Test suites that Windows and Linux CI run FIRST, before the full run, so a break fails the job
# in minutes instead of after the ~50-minute Windows run (AGE128). One GoogleTest suite-name
# pattern per line (a trailing * is fine); blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# When to add a suite: it failed on Windows or Linux only (green on the macOS gate) in 3 or more
# PR runs. Keep the whole list under ~2 minutes of test time.
ReachSweepShell*
PopupDismissPaths*
KeyStandards*
DialogTooltip*
MenuFieldSpace*
CardBodyGolden*
